244
00:16:56,360 --> 00:16:58,360
I'm begging to get me a snack.

245
00:16:58,360 --> 00:17:00,360
I'm dying over here.

246
00:17:00,360 --> 00:17:02,360
Come on, we should...

247
00:17:02,360 --> 00:17:18,360
Okay, fine. I'll do whatever you say, but nothing that results in babies, meow.

248
00:17:18,360 --> 00:17:23,360
I want to date someone and get married before I do any of that. Are we clear?

249
00:17:23,360 --> 00:17:24,360
Same for me.

250
00:17:24,360 --> 00:17:28,360
But you can still touch Lenya's boobs every now and then if you want.

251
00:17:28,360 --> 00:17:30,360
Yeah, meow. You can still...

252
00:17:30,360 --> 00:17:31,360
Wait! Why only mine?

253
00:17:31,360 --> 00:17:34,360
Mine aren't cheap. You're gonna give me the good steak for that.

254
00:17:34,360 --> 00:17:36,360
Mine aren't cheap either, meow!

255
00:17:36,360 --> 00:17:41,360
Anyway, boss, you gonna let us go or what?

256
00:17:41,360 --> 00:17:42,360
I'm boss now?

257
00:17:42,360 --> 00:17:46,360
I really am hungry. I have some jerky in my room and I can smell it from here.

258
00:17:46,360 --> 00:17:51,360
Yeah, meow. You realize we haven't had anything to eat or drink since last night.

259
00:17:51,360 --> 00:17:53,360
I don't like her tone.

260
00:17:53,360 --> 00:17:56,360
You don't sound sorry enough.

261
00:17:56,360 --> 00:18:00,360
Fitz? It's none of your business, meow.

262
00:18:00,360 --> 00:18:02,360
No kidding. No ni-nya.

263
00:18:02,360 --> 00:18:08,360
Oh, that does it! Girls, set!

264
00:18:08,360 --> 00:18:13,360
My apologies, Master Fitz. You may continue.

265
00:18:13,360 --> 00:18:15,360
This is gonna be fun.

266
00:18:15,360 --> 00:18:23,360
Hey. There's a tribe on the demon continent that uses this paint to mark their bodies when they come of age.

267
00:18:23,360 --> 00:18:27,360
The right incantation will melt the markings into your skin permanently.

268
00:18:27,360 --> 00:18:30,360
I won't forget this any time soon, Fitz.

269
00:18:30,360 --> 00:18:31,360
No ni-yo.

270
00:18:31,360 --> 00:18:39,360
If you ever disobey Rudeus, I'll cast the spell the second you do, and you will wear that shame forever!

271
00:18:39,360 --> 00:18:42,360
Master Fitz doesn't pull any punches.

272
00:18:42,360 --> 00:18:48,360
You'll keep your faces like this at school tomorrow. And then I'll remove the paint.

273
00:18:48,360 --> 00:18:56,360
Hey, boss. You knocked us out in the courtyard real fast. How could you track us so well?

274
00:18:56,360 --> 00:18:59,360
I really just remembered my training and acted accordingly.

275
00:18:59,360 --> 00:19:01,360
Meow, who was your master?

276
00:19:01,360 --> 00:19:05,360
Oh. Um... I guess Ghislaine.

277
00:19:05,360 --> 00:19:10,360
Our Ghislaine? As in Ghislaine of the Doldia tribe. Sword King Ghislaine.

278
00:19:10,360 --> 00:19:12,360
Oh, yeah. Of course her.

279
00:19:12,360 --> 00:19:19,360
That's right. If Linia is Gaius' daughter, obviously that means Ghislaine is her aunt.

280
00:19:19,360 --> 00:19:21,360
That makes sense.

281
00:19:21,360 --> 00:19:23,360
Be seeing, Mew.

282
00:19:23,360 --> 00:19:27,360
See you later, boss. I'm sorry again about your perv doll.

283
00:19:27,360 --> 00:19:29,360
Good grief.

284
00:19:29,360 --> 00:19:32,360
Um, hey, Rudeus. That wasn't too far, right?

285
00:19:32,360 --> 00:19:37,360
I don't think so. But you mentioned a special incantation for that paint.

286
00:19:37,360 --> 00:19:41,360
If anyone else knows it, we could all be in big trouble.

287
00:19:41,360 --> 00:19:46,360
Huh? Oh, uh, that was a lie. Sorry?

288
00:19:46,360 --> 00:19:50,360
That was just regular cheap paint you use for magic circles.

289
00:19:50,360 --> 00:19:52,360
Little Mana will wash it off.

290
00:19:56,360 --> 00:20:00,360
Hey, I've been curious since I walked in. What might that be?

291
00:20:00,360 --> 00:20:04,360
Oh, yeah. I keep a holy relic of my faith in it.

292
00:20:04,360 --> 00:20:08,360
Really? Then you're not a follower of Millis?

293
00:20:08,360 --> 00:20:10,360
No, sir. I'm a lifelong Roxy-

294
00:20:10,360 --> 00:20:11,360
Would you mind if I take a li- No, no, please don't open it!

295
00:20:11,360 --> 00:20:12,360
Sorry.

296
00:20:12,360 --> 00:20:15,360
The shock may be more than Master Fitz can handle.

297
00:20:15,360 --> 00:20:18,360
But, uh, yeah. Make yourself at home, otherwise.

298
00:20:18,360 --> 00:20:30,360
You weren't joking. This pillow does rattle. Can I put my head on it?

299
00:20:30,360 --> 00:20:31,360
Go ahead.

300
00:20:33,360 --> 00:20:35,360
This is really comfy.

301
00:20:35,360 --> 00:20:44,360
He even keeps the glasses on when he lies down. What would happen if I reached over and just took them off?

302
00:20:48,360 --> 00:20:49,360
Wanna see?

303
00:20:49,360 --> 00:20:52,360
To see what?

304
00:20:52,360 --> 00:20:54,360
My whole face.

305
00:20:54,360 --> 00:20:58,360
Yeah, I do.

306
00:21:12,360 --> 00:21:19,360
Uh, I'm just kidding. I can't. Under Princess Ariel's orders, I'm actually forbidden to show my face at all.

307
00:21:19,360 --> 00:21:24,360
Oh, I didn't know. Well, I won't try to force you then.

308
00:21:25,360 --> 00:21:30,360
I appreciate it. But speaking of Her Highness, I guess I had better be going.

309
00:21:31,360 --> 00:21:33,360
Sure. Thank you for everything.

310
00:21:33,360 --> 00:21:36,360
Yeah, you're welcome. And, uh, good night.

311
00:21:36,360 --> 00:21:37,360
Uh, good night.

312
00:21:45,360 --> 00:21:49,360
What would have happened if I had seen Fitz's face just now?

313
00:21:50,360 --> 00:21:55,360
For some reason, I feel like that would have been a point of no return.

314
00:23:35,980 --> 00:23:39,980
La-ya-la-ya-la

